    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Introduction",
      "source_hash": 17143975622463353612,
      "context_hash": 14321671840462676938,
      "translation": "소개",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On xilinx, yosys does not support yet generating a wide multiplier from DSPs, let's see how to do that, it is a good opportunity to see how DSPs work.",
      "source_hash": 5285074091260211312,
      "context_hash": 5536810966363329363,
      "translation": "xilinx에서는 yosys가 아직 DSP로부터 넓은 곱셈기를 생성하는 것을 지원하지 않는데, 이를 어떻게 할 수 있는지 살펴보겠습니다. DSP가 어떻게 동작하는지 살펴볼 좋은 기회입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Xilinx documentation on the DSP available in xc7 [2](https://www.xilinx.com/support/documentation/user_guides/ug479_7Series_DSP48E1.pdf) is rather hairy, so I aked on twitter and Jan Gray indicated some resources [here](https://twitter.com/jangray/status/1117464465690095616).",
      "source_hash": 9395619853009059914,
      "context_hash": 10983955042604740805,
      "translation": "xc7에서 사용 가능한 DSP에 관한 Xilinx 문서 [2](https://www.xilinx.com/support/documentation/user_guides/ug479_7Series_DSP48E1.pdf)는 다소 난해해서, 트위터에 질문했더니 Jan Gray가 [여기](https://twitter.com/jangray/status/1117464465690095616)에서 몇 가지 자료를 알려주었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "In particular, the user guide for Xilinx previous generation of DSPs [1](https://www.xilinx.com/support/documentation/user_guides/ug073.pdf) has some explations, page 33.",
      "source_hash": 6062824724986175413,
      "context_hash": 2813817709051680786,
      "translation": "특히 이전 세대 Xilinx DSP를 위한 사용자 안내서 [1](https://www.xilinx.com/support/documentation/user_guides/ug073.pdf)의 33쪽에 몇 가지 설명이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Principles",
      "source_hash": 2010953649645273171,
      "context_hash": 7201235510977475547,
      "translation": "원리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A good approach to understand something is trying to reinvent it.",
      "source_hash": 5508421099289406709,
      "context_hash": 7797061834129284352,
      "translation": "무언가를 이해하는 좋은 접근법은 그것을 재발명해보려고 시도하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "So let's imagine you want to invent a building bloc that one can assemble to create nxn multipliers, where n is an arbitrary bitwidth.",
      "source_hash": 7594596621300911248,
      "context_hash": 8280495048398100219,
      "translation": "그러니 n이 임의의 비트폭일 때, nxn 곱셈기를 만들기 위해 조립할 수 있는 building bloc을 발명하고 싶다고 상상해봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Let us take a look at how one computes a product:",
      "source_hash": 11524803757277289909,
      "context_hash": 8386179787033141990,
      "translation": "곱을 어떻게 계산하는지 살펴봅시다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:42.879050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
